--- experiments/20261017-complete-inputs/iterations/structured-literals-and-ui-actions/source-code/tests/test_browser_soundness.py	
+++ experiments/20261017-complete-inputs/iterations/structured-literals-and-ui-actions/source-code/tests/test_browser_soundness.py	
